/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * Parity fixture for the ship-build metrics: externally observed in-game totals, the power budget
 * and its priority groups, the shield and armour metrics with their stacked resistances, weapon
 * DPS, and ammunition capacity. Covers fixtures/ships/journal-anaconda-slapaconda.jsonc,
 * fixtures/ships/journal-federation-corvette-beams.jsonc, fixtures/ships/journal-cobra-mkv.jsonc,
 * fixtures/ships/journal-corsair.jsonc, fixtures/ships/journal-kestrel-mkii.jsonc,
 * fixtures/ships/journal-lynx-highliner-rescue01-current.jsonc,
 * fixtures/ships/journal-lynx-highliner-rescue.jsonc,
 * fixtures/ships/journal-panther-mkii-fat-arse.jsonc,
 * fixtures/ships/journal-python-mkii-spire-ops.jsonc, fixtures/ships/journal-the-deep-black.jsonc,
 * fixtures/ships/slef-the-deep-black.jsonc, fixtures/ships/slef-inara-panther-mkii.jsonc, an
 * Anaconda assembled from the catalogues, plus the pure functions each metric is built from.
 * Cross-language validation.
 *
 * The in-game statistics- and outfitting-panel figures here were read 2026-08-10 UTC. A panel
 * exposes no immutable revision and no export, so the values are transcribed by hand at the game's
 * displayed precision, with no correction applied — where a display and this library disagree
 * beyond rounding, the fixture records what the game showed.
 */
